  "notes": [
    "Reflexive -AR verb based on *enfermar*. Uses reflexive pronouns (me/te/se/nos/se) in all tenses.",
    "All conjugations follow regular -AR endings.",
    "*Me enfermé durante las vacaciones.* (I got ill during the holiday.)",
    "*Se enferma cada invierno.* (He gets ill every winter.)",
